title: Neon Playbook II: The Shelf Canon
id: neon-canon
tab: 16 · Neon Playbook II: The Shelf Canon
about: 16 · Act III: Gruff, Watt, Chip and Clank layer a walking canon — interrupted when Cue rips the scroll and Clank enters late
lead: gruff
key: G
bpm: 112
beat: B . t K | . Pf B . | t B . K | . B t . (swing .1)
backing: 
bass: none
finale: "Lock" on 7

[act 3]
# Small groupings build from Gruff's walking bass into a 3-voice canon with Watt & Chip.
gruff: "Braided cords keep the slow bass walk" = 0 2 4 5 4 2 1 0 | I 4, IV 4 ; do nod
gruff: "Heavy amps wake the dusty shelf" = 0 2 4 7 5 4 2 0 | V 4, I 4
  + pip @2: "Six plugs count in time" = 4/.5 5/.5 4 2 4/2
gruff: "Step by step we pass the tune round" = 0 2 4 5 4 2 1 0 | I 4, V 4 ; do tilt
  + pip @2: "Step by step we pass it" = 2 4 5 4 2 0
  + chip @4: "Pass it round the room" = 7/.5 5/.5 4/.5 2/.5 0/2

# Backstage joke: Cue's paper rips, band cuts, Clank answers a beat late with tape.
scribe: "Wait my long paper scroll just tore" = 4 4 5 7 5 4 2 1 | IV 4, V 4 ; do gasp
rest 2
clank: "Wait one beat... I found tape" = 0/2 2 4/.5 5/.5 4 2/3 | II 4, V 4 ; do nod ; react laugh

# Everyone locks the polyphonic groove together.
gruff: "Lock the groove and lift the whole room" = 0 2 4 5 7 5 4 2 | I 4, IV 4 ; do nod
  + pip @1: "Spark and hum" = 4/.5 5/.5 7/2
  + chip @2: "Bright high wings climb fast" = 7 9 8 7 9/2
  + clank @4: "Right on cue at last" = 0/.5 2/.5 4 2 0
gruff: "Four old things make one sweet new song" = 4 5 7 5 4 2 1 0 | V 4, I 4 ; do cheer
  + pip @2: "Plugged and strong" = 4 5 7/4
  + chip @4: "We sing all night" = 7 8 9 7
